# The fire arrow (reports/content/remaster/magic-fire/weapon.md): two real shots of the fire bow at the ground by the
# tavern at night. hand: the drawn arrow and the shot; flight: the second shot from the side, 5 times slower; stuck: the
# arrow in the ground; faded: 20 s after the hit, without its effect. The cameras are set on the hits this seed gives
# (41521 3354 -707 and 41649 3325 -605); a change of the aim or of the place moves them.
